  "description": "Welcome to the school Yard in Dublin 1. IRES are delighted to present this two bed apartment to the market. Located near Drumcondra village and just 20 minutes walk from Dublin City Centre, the school Yard offers residents superbly built homes, designed for a comfortable modern urban living. Apartment comes with 1 secured car parking space. Apartments at the school Yard are finished to a very high standard and are available beautifully furnished or unfurnished. All apartments are equipped with integrated kitchen appliances, quality bathrooms and large open-plan living spaces filled with natural light. Residents benefit from ample storage, with standalone utility rooms containing separate washing machines & tumble dryers. Each apartment features floor-to-ceiling balcony windows, with a generous balcony or terrace. the schoolyard also features a maintained private landscaped courtyard with a small play area, along with secure underground parking with EV charging stations and bike storage. The development also provides residents with a secure fob access control system, and an audio-visual intercom. the school yard has been built with sustainability in mind and is Ireland\\'s first LEED Gold-designed residential development, which aims to provide a healthier living space and improve the indoor environment. Residents will benefit from state-of the art features such enhanced ventilation systems, efficient water usage and reduced energy consumption. the school yard has an energy rating of A3+. Photos may vary between units. Viewing is highly recommended, please complete the online enquiry form through www.daft.ie. I-RES is the leading provider of quality professionally manged private residential rental accommodation in Ireland. As an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: - Reliable professional service, when you need it - Fully trained staff to support you at every stage - Own inhouse maintenance team - 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services - Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal We aim to reply to all emails as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages. If you do not hear from us within 48 hours, we regret that we are unable to assist you at this time. Prospect Privacy Notice: Personal data you submit in the contact form is processed by I-RES according to applicable laws and our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-",
